Tests: **9 Markdown + 7 HTML/presentation + 13 binder = 29 new tests**. Requested combined CPU subset: **131 passed**. Compilation, shell syntax, and committed-diff whitespace checks passed.

Whole-tree `git diff --check` flags whitespace in the active session log, so `static_checks.sh` returns nonzero; its refusal tests pass.

Discrepancies: the optional descriptive grid lacks a compatible canonical producer/sidecar and is therefore refused. TABLE_V1 has no verdict; TOST verdicts are validated per cell. The staging correction required one extra path-only commit.

No production results or binding report were generated. No GPU work, `ckpt/` changes, producer edits, or push.
